---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Website and Local SEO Blog | WebConvertPro"
description: "Plain-English guides on website costs, local SEO and getting more calls for GTA service businesses."
permalink: /blog/
nav: /blog/
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Blog</nav>
    <h1>Websites and local marketing, explained for business owners</h1>
    <p class="lede">What a website should cost, how to show up on Google Maps, and how to turn local searches into booked jobs.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    {%- if collections.posts.length %}
    <div class="blog-grid">
      {%- for p in collections.posts %}
      <a class="post-card" href="{{ p.url }}">
        {%- if p.data.image %}<img class="post-card-img" src="{{ p.data.image }}" alt="" width="320" height="180" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
        {%- if p.data.category %}<span class="post-category">{{ p.data.category }}</span>{% endif %}
        <h2>{{ p.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ p.data.description }}</p>
        <span class="post-date">{{ p.date | dateLong }}</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    {%- else %}
    <p class="lede">The first posts are on the way.</p>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>
